# 1. Executive Summary

COVE2E, meaning **Coverage End-to-End**, is an AI-powered insurance journey teammate designed to help customers understand, use, and recover their insurance journeys.

Insurance experiences are fragmented across policy documents, insurer portals, claim systems, document requirements, customer-support channels, and manual processes.

A customer may understand that they have insurance but still struggle to determine:

* What their policy actually covers
* Whether an incident may be covered
* What documents are required
* Why a claim is stuck
* What information is missing
* What action needs to be taken next
* Whether an insurer query has been resolved
* Whether a submitted action actually changed the claim state

COVE2E brings these interactions into one continuous AI-powered journey.

The core product promise is:

> **When your insurance journey gets stuck, COVE2E finds out why and helps get it moving again.**

COVE2E is not designed as a generic insurance chatbot.

The conversation is only the interface.

The actual product is an **insurance journey intelligence and recovery system** that maintains awareness of:

* User context
* Insurance policies
* Policy terms
* Coverage
* Exclusions
* Waiting periods
* Limits
* Deductibles
* Claim requirements
* Uploaded documents
* Claim status
* Insurer queries
* Journey state
* Outstanding actions
* Previous actions
* Recovery attempts

The central operating loop is:

```text
UNDERSTAND
     ↓
INVESTIGATE
     ↓
REASON
     ↓
POLICY / ACTION GATE
     ↓
EXECUTE
     ↓
VERIFY
     ↓
UPDATE JOURNEY
     ↓
RESOLVE / ESCALATE
```

This allows COVE2E to move beyond answering insurance questions and actively help recover blocked journeys.

